WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Bison guards Ryu’s OD uppercut after the dash.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.200
Heavy Scissors starts the punish-counter route.

3
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.100
OD Psycho Crusher triggers the cinematic mine juggle.

4
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.100
Forward heavy punch catches the launched Ryu.

5
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:09.400
Light Backfist Combo restores the mine.
